	"Description": "PRE-ALPHA, Unreal Engine 5: compiles on UE 5.6 and 5.8; the Blueprint API, settings menu, temporal resolve and Frame Generation (camera re-projection, 2x / 3x) ran in a game on 5.6 on an unlit test scene; 5.0 - 5.5 and lit scenes untested. Temporal super-resolution (render low with a jittered camera, accumulate at output resolution, sharpen) built for low-end mobile GPUs, with a single-pass spatial fallback. Dynamic mode holds your frame rate.",
